<title>FINLAND: Finnish Nov export prices fall 4.0 pct yr/yr -SF.</title>
<headline>Finnish Nov export prices fall 4.0 pct yr/yr -SF.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish markka-denominated export prices fell 0.2 percent in November on October and they fell 4.0 percent year-on-year, Statistics Finland (SF) said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>			Nov 1996	  Oct 1996	Nov 1995</p>
<p> Mth/mth	    -0.2 pct	   +0.3 pct	 +0.1 pct</p>
<p> Yr/yr		-4.0 pct	   -3.7 pct	 +9.0 pct</p>
<p>Markka-denominated import prices fell 1.2 percent month-on-month in November and they rose 2.3 percent year-on-year, SF said.  </p>
<p>(Import prices:)</p>
<p>			 Nov 1996	    Oct 1996     Nov 1995</p>
<p> Mth/mth	     -1.2 pct	    +0.6 pct     -0.9 pct</p>
<p> Yr/yr		 +2.3 pct	    +3.3 pct     -0.2 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358 - 9 - 680 50 245</p>
